        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2d puzzle-platformer with fun mechanics like picking up and placing blocks. Rescue yourself and your family after a sandstorm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/7800353279f85630685a347b3361dbf7.avif?t=1767083495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras_big/7800353279f85630685a347b3361dbf7.avif?t=1767083495 width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Squinky and go through a journey. Visit 3 different areas, discovering unique puzzle-elements. <i>Can you solve all puzzles and become a hero?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/4c1d1ed6937cecf00de56bc8480cc447.avif?t=1767083495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras_big/4c1d1ed6937cecf00de56bc8480cc447.avif?t=1767083495 width=800 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the built in level editor you can make your own levels and upload them online. Other players can play your levels and you can play their levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/d50dd000ebe59300df6dccb6af69deb9.avif?t=1767083495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras_big/d50dd000ebe59300df6dccb6af69deb9.avif?t=1767083495 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2d puzzle-platformer with fun mechanics like picking up and placing blocks. Rescue yourself and your family after a sandstorm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/7800353279f85630685a347b3361dbf7.avif?t=1767083495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras_big/7800353279f85630685a347b3361dbf7.avif?t=1767083495 width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Squinky and go through a journey. Visit 3 different areas, discovering unique puzzle-elements. <i>Can you solve all puzzles and become a hero?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/4c1d1ed6937cecf00de56bc8480cc447.avif?t=1767083495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras_big/4c1d1ed6937cecf00de56bc8480cc447.avif?t=1767083495 width=800 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the built in level editor you can make your own levels and upload them online. Other players can play your levels and you can play their levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/d50dd000ebe59300df6dccb6af69deb9.avif?t=1767083495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras_big/d50dd000ebe59300df6dccb6af69deb9.avif?t=1767083495 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
